{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>And I will make you a congregation of peoples.</b> He informed me that a congregation and peoples are yet to come forth from me — and even though He said to me 'a nation and a congregation of nations': 'a nation' He said to me for Binyamin; 'a congregation of nations' — that is two besides Binyamin. And no further son was born to me. This teaches me that one of my tribes is destined to be split. And now, that gift I give to you."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 48, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:03:53.041191641Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}